{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06582","headline":"望幸亭 · 储光羲","name":"望幸亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五年一巡狩，西幸过东畿。\n周国易居守，周人多怨思。\n君王敷惠政，程作贵从时。\n大厦非一木，沈沈临九逵。\n庆云宿飞栋，嘉树罗青墀。\n疎屏宜朝享，方塘堪水嬉。\n云中仰华盖，桁下望春旗。\n天意知如此，星言归洛师。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06582.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06582","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}